   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1.1 Enhanced capacity of civil society and citizens to engage government on implementation of anti-corruption laws, policies and accountability recommendations.</narrative>
   </title>
   <reference code="275939" vocabulary="99"></reference>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 1.1.1: Number of initiatives (accountability engagements, community sensitisation, community based monitoring, advocacy campaigns, peer education) put in place by CSOs as a result of capacity building interventions.

Indicator 1.1.2: Number of individuals participating in ACCU&#x2019;s learning events. 

Means of verification: ACCU monitoring reports, quarterly reports. 
Disaggregation: Gender, age, disability, geographical location.</narrative>
    </title>
